	(text "[source: C1] Varicap A, N1 to REF: side A's vane stack (below the hub), 6 mm\nair gaps. 128.4-450.6 pF from the 3-D solve (sim/tube-strays-findings.md section\n4; kappa 3.51) [IR: S2 re-solves it]. Carries the full node voltage: the gap\nbreaks down at 19.70 kV (sim/air_stack_sizing_results.json)."
