	(text "[source: Z1] Clamp string on N1, to REF: 66 avalanche parts of the 200 V class\nin series (1.5KE200A class), BV 13.2 kV at 1 mA. It holds N1 at 13.13 kV, x1.50\nunder the gap's 19.70 kV, and takes 0.79 W (12 mW per part, 0.64 mA peak)\n(rebuild/s1_tube/s1b_clamp_results.json). Disconnect it to run the bench without\na limit (the designer, 2026-10-16)."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 307.34 112.98 0)
