	)
	(text "Stage S1b: the S1 sheet's circuit plus the zener clamp\n(rebuild/s1_tube/s1b_clamp.py). The designer, 2026-10-16:\n  \"For now we are going to deside the zener voltage clamp. Not using it on the\n  physical bench is just matter\n  of disconnecting it.\" Level 13.13 kV (the gap's 19.70 kV / 1.5), one string per\n  node.\nClamped steady state (ngspice, real sticks, typical leakage): N1 13.13 kV, N4 13.13\nkV;\n  both strings 1.57 W together; the core's V1 - V4 -7.04 to +7.04 kV.\nThe strings' spread (N1 peak, kV): low -5pc 12.46; high +5pc 13.80; mismatch Z301+5\nZ304-5 13.73; hot +25K 13.46.\nSelf-start seed with the strings' leakage: sticks typ clamps typ <= 1; sticks typ\nclamps max 57 V; sticks typ clamps hot 690 V; sticks max clamps max 144 V; sticks\nhot clamps hot 1289 V.\nThe other limit options stay on file, to be revisited when called for: the buffer +\nconverter, the 6BK4C,\n  the sphere gap, the inductive gap across N1-N4.\nNetlist checked node for node against TOPOLOGY in rebuild/s1_tube/s1b_clamp.py, from\nwhich the study's deck\n  is written (rebuild/kicad/kicad_check_results.json)."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 294.64 140.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1de55d6b-154d-5323-b59f-44d6514eaed9")
	)
