		(property "Description" "The core's electrode pair, N1 (side A's ring, below) to N4 (side B's ring, above). The field across the core reverses every half cycle: V1 - V4 swings +/-0.54 of the varicap peak. A load on the pump, its energy reactive (it returns to the varicaps) [OC: ideal]. Value from the S2 field solve; the record's rings 1.1 pF (sim/hub-rings-build-findings.md). Not a bought part."
